```text
lief==1.0.0
```

**C++**

**Compiler command line**

```console
$ clang++ -lLIEF -I<LIEF_INSTALL>/include/ ...
```

**CMake**

```cmake
find_package(LIEF)

target_link_libraries(my-project LIEF::LIEF)
```

**Rust**

